{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50502","headline":"过中书元舍人山斋 · 宋之问","name":"过中书元舍人山斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元侯松子宾，寓此掖垣职。\n移疾多暇豫，孤斋恣闲息。\n修迳接大野，重峦跨南北。\n具物芬荣时，登攀各可极。\n林间百鸟变，郊外千花织。\n秦岭似云横，周原如黛饰。\n洛中昔游衍，常闻故园忆。\n清言尽场圃，嘉话数耘植。\n梦想恒载驰，松篁若旧识。\n酒情忽无限，琴意忻有得。\n更阅青谿诗，逾励丹霞食。\n贵者日已远，幸君惠容色。\n朅来休颍阳，任予孤且直。\n（同前见《大典》卷二五三九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}